{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_researcher_01",
      "hash": "48298d444a19f347",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "沒錯！伊布可以進化成\\n好幾種不同的形態！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "6ff940a617d7929a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布布～"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_researcher_02",
      "hash": "48298e444a19f4fa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……可是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的伊布\\n似乎不太想進化呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_researcher_03",
      "hash": "48298f444a19f6ad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這台機器看起來很像洗衣機對吧？\\n但它可不是洗衣機喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_researcher_04",
      "hash": "482988444a19eac8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀，\\n不小心用油性筆寫上去了！\\c\\n……要不要把它反過來\\n掩飾一下呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_researcher_05",
      "hash": "482989444a19ec7b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～好忙好忙！\\n忙忙忙！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_pc_01",
      "hash": "90a8a4ab33efc0ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "電腦收到了郵件！\\c\\n火焰鳥、閃電鳥和急凍鳥\\n是傳說的鳥寶可夢。\\c\\n可是我們仍然不知道\\n可以在哪裡找到牠們。\\c\\n下次我們會去調查\\n華藍市的洞窟。\\c\\n現在暫且報告到這裡。\\n……寶可夢調查隊"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_pipe_01",
      "hash": "f18ffb7a42368d7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有一根琥珀做的煙斗！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t009r0103_max",
      "hash": "c27fb5d038c3f761"
    }
  ]
}
